  "body": "## Summary\n\nFixed a duplicate word (\"with with\" → \"with\") in the snippet editor grammar documentation (`src/vs/editor/contrib/snippet/browser/snippet.md`).\n\n## Change\n\n- `src/vs/editor/contrib/snippet/browser/snippet.md`: \"Escaping is done with with the `\\` character\" → \"Escaping is done with the `\\` character\"\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git diff --check` passes (no whitespace errors)\n- Diff is intentionally tiny: 1 file, 1 line changed (docs-only)\n- Confirmed no other occurrences of the typo remain in the file\n\n## Notes\n\n- Documentation-only change; no behavioral impact.\n",
  "rebaseable": true
 },
